<title>POLAND: Polish privatisation revenues PLN 2.2 bln so far.</title>
<headline>Polish privatisation revenues PLN 2.2 bln so far.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish revenues from privatisation since the start of the year, including the giant sale of Bank Handlowy, the country's biggest bank, have reached 2.2 billion zlotys, which is more than 50 percent of this year's plan, the government spokeswoman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Aleksandra Jakubowska told journalists the government at its Tuesday session approved a report on the realisation of privatisaiton assumptions for this year.</p>
<p>-- Marcin Grajewski +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
